#0
The Void~
   This place is very odd--there is no solid ground to stand upon.
Everything seems to be floating in nothingness.  There are a few faint images
of people floating around the void.  Occasionally one winks out and
disappears, while others slowly fade in to replace them.  These images are
reflections of players who have 'lost their link' while exploring the mortal
realm.  It is not quite safe to be here, as fierce astral beings roam this
land, attacking the defenseless auras of people trapped here.  A faint portal
beckons somewhere above...
~
0 cdhnoq 0 1
